# The repo grew a 35-CRLF / 19-LF split with no rule to settle it, which makes
# every diff noisy and broke a few literal string edits outright.
#
# This only governs files from here on. To normalise what is already committed,
# run once and commit the result:
#     git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
